(SYNTHETIC DEMONSTRATION DATA -- FOR EVALUATION ONLY) Tj
T* (REFINERY STANDARD OPERATING PROCEDURE) Tj
T* (Document ID: SOP-MAINT-001 \(Version 2.4\)) Tj
T* (Title: Rotating Equipment Bearing Temperature & Vibration Monitoring) Tj
T* (1. Operating Limits:) Tj
T* (Normal bearing operating temperature for pumps and motors is up to 80 degrees C.) Tj
T* (Maximum continuous operating limit is 80 degrees C.) Tj
T* (2. Mandatory Actions:) Tj
T* (If bearing temperature exceeds 80 degrees C, record temperature and inspect bearing immediately.) Tj
T* (Schedule maintenance inspection within 24 hours to prevent cataclysmic bearing seizure.) Tj
ET
endstream
