(SYNTHETIC DEMONSTRATION DATA -- FOR EVALUATION ONLY) Tj
T* (SOP-MAINT-001 -- CORRECTIVE ACTIONS & APPROVAL PROCESS) Tj
T* (3. Corrective Actions for Thermal Exceedance \(> 80 C\):) Tj
T* (- Isolate secondary bypass if safe to do so.) Tj
T* (- Check oil reservoir and replace contaminated lubricant.) Tj
T* (- Check axial alignment and mechanical seal condition.) Tj
T* (4. Approval Authority:) Tj
T* (All repairs on Class-1 rotating equipment require an Approval Note signed by Lead Maintenance Engineer.) Tj
ET
